Draft date: 2026-08-14
Notes: Blake Snyder 15-Beat Structural Benchmark

EXT. FORSAKEN OBSERVATORY - DAWN
[BEAT: OPENING IMAGE]
A lone astronomer, CALLUM (30s), stands on the precipice of a decaying stone telescope dome overlooking an endless desert of oxidized copper sand. A broken bronze astrolabe lies at his feet.

INT. ARCHIVE CELLAR - DAY
[BEAT: THEME STATED]
Callum's mentor, PROFESSOR MIRA (70s), repairs an illuminated manuscript by candlelight.
MIRA
Knowledge without sacrifice is merely a museum of illusions, Callum.

INT. OBSERVATORY WORKSHOP - DAY
[BEAT: SET-UP]
Callum meticulously measures chemical tinctures. The shelves are filled with unpaid guild eviction notices.

INT. OBSERVATORY COURTYARD - NIGHT
[BEAT: CATALYST]
A brilliant celestial flare streaks across the heavens, crashing into the northern dunes with an emerald shockwave.

INT. OBSERVATORY LIBRARY - NIGHT
[BEAT: DEBATE]
Callum packs his saddlebags with expedition maps. Mira blocks the doorway.
MIRA
The Northern Dunes have claimed every alchemist who ever chased the Celestial Fire.

EXT. CRAGGY MOUNTAIN PASS - DAWN
[BEAT: BREAK INTO TWO]
Callum crosses the boundary stone separating the civilized valleys from the Forbidden Northern Wastes.

EXT. OASIS ENCAMPMENT - NIGHT
[BEAT: B STORY]
Callum meets KAELEN (20s, nomad scavenger, desert scout). They share bitter tea over a campfire.
KAELEN
You study the stars from books. I survive them from the sand.

EXT. CRATER BASIN - DAY
[BEAT: FUN AND GAMES]
Callum and Kaelen discover the impact site: a crystalline monolith humming with liquid luminescence. Callum collects glowing vapor vials.

EXT. MONOLITH CHAMBER - DUSK
[BEAT: MIDPOINT]
Callum activates the core matrix. A holographic celestial map expands across the desert sky. It reveals the cure for the plague ravaging the capital.

EXT. CANYON LABYRINTH - NIGHT
[BEAT: BAD GUYS CLOSE IN]
The Guild Inquisitors, led by COMMANDER VEX (40s, obsidian armor), ambush the camp with iron harpoons and burning torches.

INT. SUBTERRANEAN TOMB - NIGHT
[BEAT: ALL HOPE IS LOST]
Vex shatters Callum's extraction apparatus and takes the core matrix. Kaelen is gravely wounded in the collapse.

EXT. FLOODED CAVERN - MIDNIGHT
[BEAT: DARK NIGHT OF THE SOUL]
Callum sits in ankle-deep water beside the wounded Kaelen. His research notes float in the dark current. He realizes his selfish pride caused this disaster.

EXT. GUILD CITADEL GATES - DAWN
[BEAT: BREAK INTO THREE]
Callum uses the remaining chemical vials not for extraction, but to dismantle the Citadel's fortress gates from within.

INT. CITADEL MAIN SANCTUM - DAY
[BEAT: FINALE]
Callum confronts Vex atop the alchemical furnace. With selfless ingenuity, Callum redirects the volatile energy into the city's water aqueducts, transmuting the poison into the healing elixir for all citizens.

EXT. OBSERVATORY CLIFFS - SUNSET
[BEAT: FINAL IMAGE]
The copper desert is now blooming with green flora. Callum, surrounded by nomad apprentices, gazes through a restored golden telescope into a clear horizon.
